<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ANZ denies Stan Chart merger reports.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ANZ denies Stan Chart merger reports.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd said on Monday it is not discussing or investigating a merger with London-based bank Standard Chartered Plc, denying a newspaper report that the two banks were in merger talks.</p>
</text>
